{"script":"sub_0_09_2","des":"角色突破","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":255,"y":-403,"img":"chara003_0","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"scaleX":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":255,"y":-403,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara003_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]嗯？我记得两位应该是解决了地窖事件的契约者吧。[l]驿站能帮你们什么忙？[l][cm]","charaName":"菲尔德蕾","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]你们说……想变得更强，但无论怎么总结战斗的经验都没用，感觉陷入了瓶颈？[l][cm]","charaName":"菲尔德蕾","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]这是很自然的道理。无论再怎么锻炼，人和魔物之间就是存在力量上的差距。[l][cm]","charaName":"菲尔德蕾","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]在灾难降临时，我们曾面对过比我们强大数十倍、数百倍的魔物。[r]我们集合了所有人的力量，也才勉强守住生存的空间。你已经很强大了，契约者。[l][cm]","charaName":"菲尔德蕾","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"scaleX":0.9},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":600,"y":-403,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara003_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]照这么说，这就是我的极限了吗……[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":600,"y":-403,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara003_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]但我说的那些，只是服从“自然”规律所得出来的答案。[l][cm]","charaName":"菲尔德蕾","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]还记得你们之前在地窖中击败的巨大蜘蛛个体吗？[r][l]其实我们并不认为砂蜘蛛这样的魔物，在自然的条件下，能强大到这种地步。[l][cm]","charaName":"菲尔德蕾","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":600,"y":-403,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara003_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]您的意思是……[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":600,"y":-403,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara003_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]在你们走后，我的卫兵们在那头蜘蛛的体内发现了这个。[l][cm]","charaName":"菲尔德蕾","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":600,"y":-403,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara003_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]哇……这是什么？火红色的……结晶？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":600,"y":-403,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara003_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]元素师们也报告说，他们能在其中感受到浑厚的火属性元素力量。[l][cm]","charaName":"菲尔德蕾","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]我们判断，这些结晶和魔物的暴乱有关。[r][l]也许这种从被异变影响的地脉吸收了足够多力量的魔物个体，就会更强大。[l][cm]","charaName":"菲尔德蕾","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":600,"y":-403,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara003_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]也就是说，这就是能够“不自然”变强的方法！[r][l]%主人公，你不是见得多嘛，也来看看这个呀！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":600,"y":-403,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara003_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]在调查“异变”这件事上，你们也是功臣。这些结晶，我就交给你们使用了。[l][cm]","charaName":"菲尔德蕾","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]既然这些结晶因混乱的地脉而生，那只要你们继续旅途，[r]探查更多魔物狂暴化的线索，应该能获得更多类似的元素结晶吧。[l][cm]","charaName":"菲尔德蕾","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":600,"y":-403,"transTime":300,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara003_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]但……这种东西到底要怎么用呢……[r][l]看起来也不像可以吃的样子……难道要镶嵌到武器里？磨成粉糊在脸上？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":50,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{